{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_4460684fd98a4483bb98343f44fb6dc0","id":"pg_873ab403d6cf543788f9586ebad6d228","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-2389-agent-rust-readme-md-9ebe8438dbdb-586ebad6d228.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_05a4d17397cc57708c0d8403b1db54e6"],"title":"2389-research/2389-agent-rust/README.md @ 9ebe8438dbdb","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4460684fd98a4483bb98343f44fb6dc0"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_08094b898032f30087693c9da28d6e638d9bf0c3792e2890bfbcce87657dcba4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The threat model names four trust boundaries: the MQTT network perimeter, process isolation around tool execution, the LLM provider API boundary, and input validation at the data boundary."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0e8319ee1c7a4658b65ec1218313a80514e3998cfe89b389333076ef4236cc57"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Rust-language decision record acknowledges two consequences: a steeper learning curve for contributors unfamiliar with Rust, and longer compile times than an interpreted language would have."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1fb3cce3856d8599171fd91df82c91b29b7b646623c9e4896d45842692066fd9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The architecture doc describes this project as a Rust implementation of the 2389 Agent Protocol, with agents interoperating over MQTT and an emphasis on reliability and strict protocol compliance."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3b5d917c455185f35669ddd1720db8f4053dd56edb676bc092c72b28dd78233c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A second accepted decision record names rumqttc as the MQTT client library, noting it avoids external C dependencies since it is a pure-Rust implementation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_40000d59be14b8c76d56b55f1beca7e77d0b0dfa088e8096c42f202ddd1cf026"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documentation describes an explicit agent lifecycle moving through Uninitialized, Initializing, Running, Stopping and Stopped, with any state able to transition to an Error state on failure."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a4c2a78039fc7ff988af0410b5cebc648537754390b8a637bc4b363bcdab023b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An accepted architecture decision record states Rust was chosen for the core implementation, citing memory safety without garbage-collection overhead and strong async support as rationale."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c6ce283c6a9311c402be2b9cb45ac246f41dd74cdc812a280afec3a3379c0e1d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Listed tool-execution security controls include JSON-schema validation of parameters, per-tool process isolation with timeouts, and restricting available tools to an allow-list."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fd4cc04f0f0c6bb196ea2241262581ce69d2ab73c38155a2b3c5358e65a098cc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The LLM integration layer is documented as provider-agnostic behind a shared trait, with Anthropic Claude and OpenAI GPT listed as the currently supported providers."}],"claim_ids":["clm_08094b898032f30087693c9da28d6e638d9bf0c3792e2890bfbcce87657dcba4","clm_0e8319ee1c7a4658b65ec1218313a80514e3998cfe89b389333076ef4236cc57","clm_1fb3cce3856d8599171fd91df82c91b29b7b646623c9e4896d45842692066fd9","clm_3b5d917c455185f35669ddd1720db8f4053dd56edb676bc092c72b28dd78233c","clm_40000d59be14b8c76d56b55f1beca7e77d0b0dfa088e8096c42f202ddd1cf026","clm_a4c2a78039fc7ff988af0410b5cebc648537754390b8a637bc4b363bcdab023b","clm_c6ce283c6a9311c402be2b9cb45ac246f41dd74cdc812a280afec3a3379c0e1d","clm_fd4cc04f0f0c6bb196ea2241262581ce69d2ab73c38155a2b3c5358e65a098cc"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_4460684fd98a4483bb98343f44fb6dc0","id":"pg_8ff0ddec33e95217b3172206a04eb5a9","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-2389-agent-rust-docs-architecture-md-9ebe8438dbdb-2206a04eb5a9.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_137487f9e035524581ab74c136f065a2"],"title":"2389-research/2389-agent-rust/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md @ 9ebe8438dbdb","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:48:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4460684fd98a4483bb98343f44fb6dc0"}
